cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SpatioEv in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata below. Until a formal journal article is available, cite
  the GitHub repository and include the commit hash used for analysis.

title: "SpatioEv: a spatial feature extraction and evolution framework
  for multiplexed imaging and spatial transcriptomics"

authors:
